5. AUTHORIZED UMD TEAM LICENSE

Subject to every condition and restriction in this License, the Authorized UMD
Team may reproduce, execute, modify, create derivative works from, and
internally distribute Covered Material for its own educational, research,
vehicle-development, testing, and competition activities. It may deploy
Covered Material on or in connection with its own vehicles.

The Authorized UMD Team may share Covered Material with UMD faculty, advisors,
sponsors, contractors, and service providers solely as necessary to support
the Authorized UMD Team, provided each recipient is bound in writing to use it
only for that support, to protect nonpublic material, and not to Distribute it
further. This Section does not authorize public Distribution or use for any
other Competition Program.

6. MATERIAL COMPETITION RESTRICTION

6.1 Except for the Authorized UMD Team under Section 5, You must not, directly
or indirectly:

(a) make any Competition Use of Covered Material;

(b) provide Covered Material, a modified version, or access to either to a
Competing Team;

(c) run Covered Material using actual, estimated, fictionalized, or anonymized
parameters, telemetry, track data, or requirements for the benefit of a
Competing Team;

(d) use a contractor, consultant, sponsor, vendor, cloud service, automated
agent, artificial-intelligence system, or other intermediary to do anything
this License prohibits You from doing directly;

(e) use Covered Material, a modified version, or software-generated output to
train, fine-tune, retrieve for, evaluate, or operate an artificial-intelligence
or machine-learning system for Competition Use; or

(f) use output from Covered Material when that output was generated in breach
of this License.

6.2 The restrictions in this Section are material conditions of every license
grant. No permission is granted for an act that violates them.

